
# H2 CICIoT2023 Machine Learning Analysis

**H2: A Random Forest model provides the highest spoofing detection accuracy in IoT baggage tracking data compared to other ML models.**

**RQ2: Which ML models are most effective at detecting spoofing in Internet of Things enabled baggage tracking data?**

This notebook extends the H2 Machine Learning analysis by comparing Logistic Regression, Support Vector Machine, and Random Forest using the CICIoT2023 cybersecurity dataset. The public network traffic data is evaluated separately from the prepared RFID baggage tracking records. This additional analysis examines how the three models identify malicious network activity and provides supporting cybersecurity evidence for the H2 comparison.

**BLUF:** The analysis examines which of the three Machine Learning models provides the strongest detection performance using CICIoT2023 network traffic data. These results supplement the original H2 findings but do not directly measure spoofed RFID baggage scans.



